e: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Repair the red master CI lanes[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every GitHub Actions job on the sase default branch — lint, test [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](3.12/3.13/3.14), coverage-contexts, and visual-test — passes on a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]clean master tree, with each failure fixed at its own root cause [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]rather than muted.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]repair_red_master_ci.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Delete the dead glossary and memory-web symbols[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]symvision[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]symvision: retire the ten unused public symbols the config-glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]retirement stranded, so the lint job's symvision stage passes again.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Refresh the bead CLI note fixtures and assertions[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bead-notes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead-notes: regenerate the six bead CLI goldens for the structured-note [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire, retarget the compact-search assertion, and replace the hardcoded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]history date literal with a computed one.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Re-review the split agent-chat marker-path sites[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]marker-audit[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF